    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 16 • Politely Disagreeing With Someone",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "If Kroll Enterprises doesn't take action soon, the company is going to be in financial trouble. Joel and Kathy have different opinions on how to cut costs at the company."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kathy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "We're going to be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "in the red"
                },
                {
                  "text": " again this year."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Joel: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I think we should "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "cut back on"
                },
                {
                  "text": " employee health benefits. We could "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "save a bundle"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kathy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "True, it might help the "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "bottom line"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", but our employees would be really unhappy. I would only recommend it as a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "last resort"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Joel: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, we need to do some "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "belt-tightening"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". We can either have a salary freeze or we can cut back on their health benefits. I think I've chosen "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "the lesser of two evils"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kathy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Another salary freeze is "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "out of the question"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". All our best employees will quit."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Joel: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I'm caught "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "between a rock and a hard place"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". I have to cut costs."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kathy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Do you really? I don't think cutting costs is "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "the name of the game"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". I think the secret is figuring out how to increase our sales."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Joel: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "How do you suggest we "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "pull that off"
                },
                {
                  "text": "?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kathy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Let's meet with the other vice presidents and "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "bat around some ideas"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Joel: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "We can talk "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "until we're blue in the face"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". We need to take action now."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kathy: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "It's clear that you and I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "don't see eye-to-eye"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". For now, "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "let's just agree to disagree"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
